type: software
title: "AfAME: Parallel Tempering and Algebraic Certification of AME States"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dahbiz/AmePhaseStates"
url: "https://github.com/dahbiz/AmePhaseStates"
authors:
  - family-names: Dahbi
    given-names: Zakaria
abstract: >-
  AfAME searches quadratic-phase quantum states using finite-field cut ranks
  and parallel tempering, and certifies candidates using exhaustive cut
  enumeration and an independent Python verifier.
keywords:
  - quantum information
  - absolutely maximally entangled states
  - parallel tempering
  - finite fields
  - graph states
